	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• バララント軍の主力AT“ファッティー”が陸戦仕様でキット化。",
			"• 肩のスイング機構によりガトリングガンを両手で構えることが可能。",
			"• ヒザを中心にした4重関節機構により降着ポーズを再現可能。",
			"• コクピット内部にはバララント兵が着座、内部ディテールも精密再現。",
			"• 大型グライディングホイールがスライドし走行状態を表現。",
			"• ガトリングガンは内部メカニクスまで再現、予備弾倉は背部ミッションパックに装着可能。",
			"• ガトリングガンのほか、ペールゼンファイルズに登場したマシンガンも装備。",
			"• ファッティーと同スケールの対ATライフルが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• The main AT of the Balarant army, “Fatty”, has been made into a kit with land battle specifications.",
			"• The shoulder swing mechanism allows you to hold the Gatling gun with both hands.",
			"• The accretion pose can be reproduced by the quadruple joint mechanism centered on the knees.",
			"• Ballant soldiers are seated inside the cockpit, and internal details are precisely reproduced.",
			"• The large gliding wheel slides to express the running condition.",
			"• The internal mechanics of the Gatling gun have been recreated, and the spare magazine can be attached to the mission pack on the back.",
			"• In addition to the Gatling gun, it is also equipped with the machine gun that appeared in Pailsen Files.",
			"• Comes with an anti-AT rifle of the same scale as Fatty."
		]
	},
